RetroBake - third-party notices
===============================

The files under third_party/ are copied unchanged from their upstream projects. Every
original header and licence file is kept. third_party/SHA256SUMS lists the exact file
hashes. RetroBake's own build script, start-up code, placeholder art and placeholder music
are original and are not covered by this file.

Doug Fraker - nesdoug library (third_party/nesdoug/)
----------------------------------------------------
Files: LIB/nesdoug.s, LIB/nesdoug.h, LIB/neslib.s, LIB/neslib.h (taken from the
"26_Full_Game" example of nesdoug's NES tutorial). Only the LIB folder and the licence were
taken. No art, music, levels, makefiles or start-up code from that example are used.
Licence: MIT. Copyright (c) 2018 Doug Fraker. Full text: third_party/nesdoug/License.txt.
LIB/neslib.s and LIB/neslib.h are Shiru's neslib with improvements by VEG and Doug Fraker. Their
headers state: "NES hardware-dependent functions by Shiru (shiru@mail.ru) with improvements by
VEG. Feel free to do anything you want with this code, consider it Public Domain."

Shiru and Lauri Kasanen - neslib (third_party/neslib/)
------------------------------------------------------
Files: neslib.sinc, display.sinc, famitone2.sinc, lz4vram.s, neslib.h (clbr/neslib).
crt0.s is intentionally NOT included because it .incbins a sample music file.
Licence: zlib. (C) 2015 Alex Semenov (Shiru), (C) 2016 Lauri Kasanen.
Full text: third_party/neslib/COPYING.
famitone2.sinc is Shiru's FamiTone2, which its author released as public domain.
RetroBake's ROM build uses the nesdoug LIB copy of neslib. This copy is kept for reference.

Mathieu Gauthier - FamiStudio sound engine (third_party/famistudio/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
Files: famistudio_ca65.s, famistudio_cc65.h.
Notice, kept in the source header: "Copyright (c) 2019-2026 Mathieu Gauthier. Copying and
distribution of this file, with or without modification, are permitted in any medium without
royalty provided the copyright notice and this notice are preserved in all source code copies.
This file is offered as-is, without any warranty." The engine is based on FamiTone2 by Shiru.
The repository's own LICENSE file (MIT, Copyright (c) 2019 BleuBleu) is kept as
third_party/famistudio/LICENSE.
The engine's note-table .bin files are not copied. RetroBake's build script computes them from
the standard NTSC formula and checks them against the upstream SHA-256 hashes.

